      "company": "Fieldly",
      "type": "adjacent",
      "severity": "manageable",
      "rationale": "Fieldly covers field operations workflow, which overlaps substantially with Cadence's technician routing and job tracking. The distinction between 'workflow' and 'scheduling/dispatch' is thin at the SMB field-service layer; some customer segments would evaluate both."
    },
