      "company": "TradeRoute",
      "type": "adjacent",
      "severity": "manageable",
      "rationale": "TradeRoute targets construction workforce scheduling \u2014 a trade-services vertical adjacent to Cadence's SMB field-service market. Both solve technician/worker scheduling problems; buyers in adjacent trades (e.g., electrical, general contracting) may evaluate both products."
    },
